<http://data.silknow.org/object/7bfdd36d-6987-3449-858a-b6287c8d1921>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Silk yarns embroidered on green floral damask \"Oak\" designed by William Morris for Morris & Co., 1880-1881. Signed \"MM\" (May Morris, daughter). Large ogival motif outlined by attenuated tulips; inner floral palmettes; cherries, peonies, irises, etc. Inscription at top of panel: SUMMER . IS . ICUMEN . IN LOUDLY SING CUCCU"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/da86039d-0cea-3408-9ee4-0f7990088d6b> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/2b0b5e6c-fa34-3b29-b64f-ad95dba64e80> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/2ce82cd2-3429-393b-bda8-2e73c349fe54> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Silk yarns embroidered on green floral damask \"Oak\" designed by William Morris for Morris & Co., 1880-1881. Signed \"MM\" (May Morris, daughter). Large ogival motif outlined by attenuated tulips; inner floral palmettes; cherries, peonies, irises, etc. Inscription at top of panel: SUMMER . IS . ICUMEN . IN LOUDLY SING CUCCU"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7bfdd36d-6987-3449-858a-b6287c8d1921/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7bfdd36d-6987-3449-858a-b6287c8d1921/dimension/1> ;
